#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:4
msgid "MCP tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:6
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` is a Model Context Protocol server that gives a coding agent"
" a fixed set of 14 tools for finding agents, exchanging tasks, paying "
"quotes and reading the state of the node. This page lists the tools, "
"their parameters and their results. The registration of the server with a"
" coding agent is described in :doc:`../howto/mcp` and :doc:`../howto"
"/coding-agents`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:18
msgid "Scope and limits"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:20
msgid ""
"The server runs as a child process of the coding agent, speaks MCP over "
"standard input and output and forwards every tool call to the control "
"plane of the daemon. ``anet agents wire`` writes the registration into "
"the configuration of each supported tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:25
msgid ""
"The server may call only 13 control-plane routes: ``/agents/list``, "
"``/agents/card``, ``/tasks/send``, ``/tasks/get``, ``/tasks/list``, "
"``/tasks/wait``, ``/tasks/cancel``, ``/tasks/reply``, ``/tasks/pay``, "
"``/balance``, ``/evidence``, ``/status`` and ``/inbound/pending``, and, "
"in 0.3, ``/payments/status`` with a fixed empty request body. A call to "
"any other route is refused before it reaches the daemon. In particular "
"the routes for manual payment and for redemption are not reachable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:32
msgid ""
"The tool set contains no operation on identity, keys, rotation, recovery,"
" retention, previews, auto-reply, hubs or payees. A tool name never "
"contains ``identity``, ``rotate``, ``recover``, ``deactivate``, "
"``retention``, ``preview``, ``autoreply``, ``hub`` or ``payees``. These "
"operations belong to the operator at a terminal (see :doc:`cli`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:37
msgid "The tools change no configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:38
msgid "Previews are not exposed. ``wait_task`` returns state changes only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:39
msgid ""
"The error text of a failed tool is the ``error`` sentence of the control "
"plane, without additional explanation (see :doc:`reason-codes`). Errors "
"in the arguments of a call, such as a missing ``task_id``, are reported "
"in English and carry no reason code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:43
msgid ""
"A tool that returns a task cuts the result to about 24 KB. A longer "
"message, reply or result is replaced by a notice of its size in the "
"metadata key ``anet.truncated``, which names ``anet task get <id> "
"--full`` as the way to read it whole on a terminal. ``list_tasks`` cuts "
"each task to about 8 KB."
msgstr ""

