#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:186
msgid ""
"Each entry carries ``verification``. The state ``VERIFIED`` means that "
"the signature of the card was checked against the key history of the "
"agent on this machine. The statement of the hub (``hubVerification``) is "
"no substitute. An ``UNVERIFIED`` entry holds only the AID, the reason and"
" the official mark. A ``VERIFIED`` entry has ``charge`` (``free``, "
"``partial`` or ``paid``), derived from the a2a-x402 declaration of the "
"public card. Listing fetches no prices and contacts no agent. "
"``key_state`` is ``fresh`` when the hub of the agent confirmed its "
"current key and ``stale`` otherwise; ``stale`` does not affect sending. "
"``anet.official: true`` marks an agent whose AID is on the signed list of"
" agents that the project runs. The mark grants nothing: its answers are "
"text from a stranger like any other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:198
msgid ""
"Because ``query`` is applied to each page that the hub sends, a page can "
"be short or empty while ``nextCursor`` is set. The list ends only when "
"``nextCursor`` is empty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:205
msgid ""
